  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.ploytos_proteros.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.ploytos_proteros.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.ploytos_proteros.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_ploytos_proteros"><head>ΠΛΟΥΤΟΣ ΠΡΟΤΕΡΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="447" xml:id="kock-0019-ploytos_proteros-447" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_ploytos_proteros">
              <p>ἐμπαίζειν</p>
              <note type="source">ἐπὶ τοῦ καταγελᾶν. Ἀριστοφάνης Πλούτῳ. Bekker. Anecd. 95, 29. Soph. Ant. 800.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="448" xml:id="kock-0019-ploytos_proteros-448" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_ploytos_proteros">
              <p>ἐπικρούσασθαι</p>
              <note type="source">Pollux 9, 139 Ἀριστοφάνης δ’ ἐν Πλούτῳ καὶ τῷ ἐπικρ. ἐπὶ τοῦ νουθετῆσαι κέχρηται.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="449" xml:id="kock-0019-ploytos_proteros-449" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_ploytos_proteros">
              <p>ζυγοποιεῖν</p>
              <note type="source">ὡς ἐν Πλούτῳ Ἀριστοφάνης. Pollux 7, 115.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Aristophanem falso pro Pherecrate (130, 1) nominari Dobraeus opinabatur Plut. 115, alii ad Plut. 513 referebant. neutrum recte mea sententia, cum praesertim, si Dobraeum sequamur, Pollux non solum Aristophanem cum Pherecrate, sed etiam Plutum cum Persis et ζυγοποιεῖν cum ζυγοποιῶν (a ζυγοποιός) confudisse censendus sit.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="450" xml:id="kock-0019-ploytos_proteros-450" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_ploytos_proteros">
              <p>ῥυφῆσαι</p>
              <note type="source">διὰ τοῦ υ Ἀριστοφάνης Πλούτῳ. Bekker. Anecd. 113, 11. ῥοφῆσαι Eq. 912.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">ῥυφεῖν cum sit forma Ionica, Ionem aliquem poeta loquentem induxit.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>
